    <div class="actions"><a class="icon-btn" href="{{ routes.search_url }}" aria-label="Search">⌕</a><a class="icon-btn" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart">🛒<span class="cart-count" data-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span></a></div>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="top">
  <div class="section seo-copy"><h1>Adult Toys &amp; Intimate Wellness at Velvet Secret</h1><p>Shop trusted adult toys, sex toys and intimate wellness products for every body. Explore vibrators, massage wands, couples toys, lubricants and discreet pleasure essentials with private delivery.</p></div>
  <section class="hero"><picture><source media="(max-width:560px)" srcset="{{ 'hero-mobile.png' | asset_url }}"><img src="{{ 'hero-desktop.png' | asset_url }}" alt="New in collection"></picture><div class="hero-copy"><a class="btn light" href="/collections/new-in">Shop new in</a></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="products"><div class="section-head"><h2>Find your pleasure</h2><p>Curated intimate wellness for every body and every kind of connection.</p></div><div class="tabs" data-tabs><button class="tab active" type="button">For Women</button><button class="tab" type="button">For Men</button><button class="tab" type="button">For Couples</button></div><div class="products">
    {% assign featured = collections.all.products | default: blank %}
