  </div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">View all toys</a></div></section>
  <div class="feature-strip"><div><strong>Premium quality</strong><span>Body-safe materials</span></div><div><strong>Discreet packaging</strong><span>Private delivery, always</span></div><div><strong>Expert advice</strong><span>Guides for every journey</span></div><div><strong>Free UK shipping</strong><span>On orders over £45</span></div></div>
  <section class="section" id="categories"><div class="section-head"><h2>Shop by category</h2><p>Start with what feels right for you.</p></div><div class="category-grid"><a class="category" href="/collections/for-women"><h3>For Her</h3><span class="btn">View products</span></a><a class="category" href="/collections/for-men"><h3>For Him</h3><span class="btn">View products</span></a><a class="category" href="/collections/couples"><h3>For Couples</h3><span class="btn">View products</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="section split" id="about"><div class="split-panel"><h2>Explore a world of sensations</h2><p>Discover intimate massagers, discreet vibrators, couples' toys and more. Whether you are new to pleasure or a seasoned explorer, our selection has something for everyone.</p><a class="btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Explore the collection</a></div><div class="split-panel"><h2>Expert advice for your journey</h2><p>Our guides and reviews help you make confident choices, learn new techniques and find products that fit your preferences.</p><a class="btn" href="/blogs/news">Read the journal</a></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="journal"><div class="section-head"><h2>From the journal</h2><p>Practical, inclusive advice for better intimacy.</p></div><div class="articles"><article class="article"><h3>Choosing your first intimate toy</h3><p>A simple, no-pressure guide to materials, shapes and sensations.</p><a href="/blogs/news">Read more →</a></article><article class="article"><h3>Couples' toys for modern intimacy</h3><p>Ideas for exploring connection, play and pleasure together.</p><a href="/blogs/news">Read more →</a></article><article class="article"><h3>Make space for better intimacy</h3><p>Small, practical ideas for a more connected pleasure journey.</p><a href="/blogs/news">Read more →</a></article></div></section>
