</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="footer-inner"><div><div class="footer-brand"><img src="{{ 'logo.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}"><span class="brand-name">Velvet Secret</span></div><p>Your pleasure, your way. Quality intimate wellness with discreet delivery.</p><p>Free UK shipping over £45</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href="/collections/for-women">For Women</a><a href="/collections/for-men">For Men</a><a href="/collections/couples">Couples</a><a href="/collections/sale">Sale</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href="/pages/shipping">Shipping &amp; delivery</a><a href="/pages/faq">FAQ</a><a href="/pages/returns">Returns</a><a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a></div><div><h4>About</h4><a href="/pages/about">Our story</a><a href="/blogs/news">Journal</a><a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy</a><a href="/policies/terms-of-service">Terms</a></div></div><div class="copyright">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} Velvet Secret · Pleasure for every body</div></footer>
